B.EQ=new A.V(20,"Play the move you can explain",B.Z,"The habit worth keeping is small: before you drop a piece, say in one sentence what it does. Wins, blocks, builds, or takes a square they want. Here exactly one column can be explained, and it is the only one that wins.",B.e8,B.Jv,2,5,B.k,"Column 3 forces a win five plies from here; every other column loses. This is the whole course in one position. Every lesson before it was a category of sentence you might say about a move \u2014 and after each match, the insight screen shows the one move where the game turned, so you can read it against the sentence you told yourself at the time.",!0,B.i,null,null)
